  <p>
    <strong>Choose <a href={gumroadUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gumroad</a> if</strong> you have a first product and no audience yet, and you want to be selling today with no subscription and no tax setup. <strong>Skip Gumroad if</strong> your product is cheap and your volume is real — past a few hundred dollars a month, its percentage costs more than a subscription — or if a frozen payout would genuinely hurt you.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Choose <a href={stanStoreUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stan Store</a> if</strong> your traffic is social, your storefront is a link in bio, and you realistically expect $250+/mo in sales to make the 0% fee beat Gumroad's cut. <strong>Skip Stan if</strong> you are pre-revenue and unsure the product will sell (rent first, proof later is the wrong order), or if you need email sending and upsells without jumping to $99/mo.
  </p>
  <p>
